msgctxt "64"
msgid "Thanks for talkin' to him, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"But if we're really gonna look for Saki... I don't have the\r\n"
"slimmest idea of where to start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Then we'll just have to ask around. We can focus on the area\r\n"
"right around the office for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "But we already combed every last nook n' cranny!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "...Nobody's seen her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "And you don't know where her mom lives?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Nope, sorry to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Is there anywhere you haven't looked?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Nowhere she'd be likely to turn up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Only stone left unturned is <Color:7>Hatsumachi<Color:Default>..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "<Color:7>Hatsumachi<Color:Default>? Why haven't you checked there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Place is the biggest red light district on the island. Chock\r\n"
"full o' hostess clubs, brothels... All sorts of smut a kid's\r\n"
"not gonna go anywhere near."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Besides..."
msgstr "Inoltre..."

msgctxt "220"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"It's Tamashiro Family turf. Things'd get real hairy\r\n"
"real fast if we showed our faces over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Then it's settled. We're going to <Color:7>Hatsumachi<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "But Aniki, I just told you! <Color:7>Hatsumachi<Color:Default>'s⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"The only place you haven't looked. I don't care whose turf\r\n"
"it is. We're going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Well? You're welcome to stay behind if you think the\r\n"
"Tamashiro are really that scary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Like hell that's gonna happen! I'm comin', Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Good. Now let's go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "All right!"
msgstr "Bene!"

